### User Service Verification Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

### 1. Register User (Create Profile)
# Expect: 201 Created, returns generated ID
# ID in body should be IGNORED
# You can copy the returned "id" for the next steps
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "this-should-be-ignored",
    "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
    "phone": "0987654321",
    "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
    "role": "PASSENGER",
    "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}

### 2. Verify Username Endpoint is GONE
# Expect: 404 CANNOT GET
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/username/someusername

### 3. Get User by ID (Using ID from Step 1)
@userId = <REPLACE_WITH_ID_FROM_STEP_1>
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-User-Role: PASSENGER

### 4. Update User Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-User-Role: PASSENGER

{
    "fullName": "Nguyen Van A Updated",
    "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 5. Add User Address
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-User-Role: PASSENGER

{
    "label": "Home",
    "address": "123 Main St, Hanoi",
    "lat": 21.0285,
    "lng": 105.8542
}

### 6. Get User Addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/addresses
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-User-Role: PASSENGER

### 7. Verify Phone Check (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/phone/0987654321
X-User-Id: admin-id
X-User-Role: ADMIN
